expression: text
---
Compare up to four data points over the same time, or one point with itself
shifted back (--shift 7d = the same hours a week earlier).

Usage: hn values compare [OPTIONS] <TARGETS>...

Arguments:
  <TARGETS>...  Data point ids or SENSOR/TYPE (1 to 4)

Options:
      --from <TIME>   Start: 24h, 7d, 90m, 2026-11-01 or 2026-11-01T10:00+01:00 [default: 24h]
      --to <TIME>     End, same forms as --from [default: now]
      --shift <SPAN>  Compare one point with itself this long ago (for example 7d)
  -h, --help          Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn values compare <point-id> <point-id>
  hn values compare <sensor-id>/temperature --shift 7d --from 24h
